  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_poke_01",
      "hash64": "047BA5D75672BD77",
      "text": "Grawawa!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_01",
      "hash64": "9042782F47699201",
      "text": "Hey, wait a minute—don’t I know you from\\nsomewhere?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_02",
      "hash64": "9042752F47698CE8",
      "text": "That’s right! My old partner! How are you,\\npartner—I mean, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_select_01",
      "hash64": "A9B6CC034E7F0708",
      "text": "Whoa! Perrin!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_select_02",
      "hash64": "A9B6CF034E7F0C21",
      "text": "Do I know you...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_03",
      "hash64": "9042762F47698E9B",
      "text": "That’s right! Good ol’ Perrin is still kicking\\naround! You’re doing well yourself, eh?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_04",
      "hash64": "90427B2F4769971A",
      "text": "Now, come on! Don’t you pull that on me!\\c\\nYou remember your old pal Perrin, right? I can’t\\nbelieve you’re actually that heartless![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_05",
      "hash64": "90427C2F476998CD",
      "text": "I sure appreciated all the help you gave me back\\nin Kitakami, tracking down the Bloodmoon Beast.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_24",
      "hash64": "903B672F47635670",
      "text": "I never thought I’d just bump into you like this.\\nHow about I teach you a new pose to celebrate![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_system_01",
      "hash64": "281F9E2E7F49CB0B",
      "text": "You learned the [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]Looking Good! emote[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] from\\nPerrin!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_06",
      "hash64": "9042792F476993B4",
      "text": "Oh! And you even managed to evolve that\\nGrowlithe I entrusted to you?![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_07",
      "hash64": "90427A2F47699567",
      "text": "He looks great! That’s one splendid specimen\\nof an Arcanine![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_08",
      "hash64": "90426F2F476982B6",
      "text": "Look at that, Growlithe! Your brother’s been\\nso well taken care of. And now you’re reunited![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_poke_02",
      "hash64": "047BA6D75672BF2A",
      "text": "Grawa!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_09",
      "hash64": "9042702F47698469",
      "text": "Oh! And that’s the Growlithe I entrusted to you!\\nSo you’ve been adventuring together, huh?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_10",
      "hash64": "90457D2F476BD057",
      "text": "Look at that, Growlithe! It’s your brother! I told\\nyou that you’d meet each other again![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_poke_03",
      "hash64": "047BA7D75672C0DD",
      "text": "Grawa!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_11",
      "hash64": "90457C2F476BCEA4",
      "text": "Oh! But what about that Growlithe I entrusted\\nto you? Is he doing all right?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_12",
      "hash64": "90457F2F476BD3BD",
      "text": "I hope you put him on your team sometimes\\nand do a bit of adventuring together![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_poke_04",
      "hash64": "047BA0D75672B4F8",
      "text": "Grawww...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_13",
      "hash64": "90457E2F476BD20A",
      "text": "So you’re here as some sorta exchange student,\\nhuh? Nice![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_14",
      "hash64": "9045792F476BC98B",
      "text": "What a coincidence—I just started working here!\\nAs a photographer, of course![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_select_03",
      "hash64": "A9B6CE034E7F0A6E",
      "text": "That’s amazing!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_select_04",
      "hash64": "A9B6D1034E7F0F87",
      "text": "Just what I’d expect!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_15",
      "hash64": "9045782F476BC7D8",
      "text": "Heh heh! Yeah, it pretty much is, right?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_16",
      "hash64": "90457B2F476BCCF1",
      "text": "Heh heh! That’s typical me, eh?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_17",
      "hash64": "90457A2F476BCB3E",
      "text": "Though I’m still sort of waiting to hear if the\\nschool likes my work, to be fair.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_18",
      "hash64": "9045752F476BC2BF",
      "text": "They say they want snapshots of the Terarium and\\nthe students and all for upcoming marketing stuff,\\r\\nso...how about some photos of you?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_19",
      "hash64": "9045742F476BC10C",
      "text": "Ah! Speaking of photos, I’ve got a [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]hot tip[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] I could\\nlet you in on![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_20",
      "hash64": "903B6B2F47635D3C",
      "text": "But if I told you, I bet you’d just go running right\\noff...[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_21",
      "hash64": "903B6C2F47635EEF",
      "text": "How about this: I’ll snap some candid shots of\\nyou catching tons of Pokémon in the Terarium.\\r\\nDon’t worry—you won’t even notice I’m nearby![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_22",
      "hash64": "903B6D2F476360A2",
      "text": "If I make enough headway in my work by the\\ntime you register, say...200 Pokémon in the\\r\\nBlueberry Pokédex, I’ll share that [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]hot tip[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_23",
      "hash64": "903B6E2F47636255",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Hey, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Don’t you have\\nsome\\r\\nhomework?\\r\\nI\\r\\ngave\\r\\nyou\\r\\nan\\r\\nassignment,\\r\\nremember?\\c\\nGo register at least 200 Pokémon in the\\nBlueberry Pokédex, then report back to me!\\c\\nTime is money! Don’t go wasting it![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
